## 4. Protected regression list (Gate 3 — not run)

Policy **OFF** (or real guard with no published policy and no Pending):

- `PoPrServiceTests`
- `PoOrderServiceTests`
- `IvGoodsReceiptServiceTests`
- `IvInventoryPostingServiceTests` (stock/FIFO/rollback)
- PR consumption / remaining-qty tests (formula unchanged)
- Invoice net-received (`ValidateMatchOnPostAsync`)
- CDN / VR / GR rollback

Policy **ON** (isolated DB only):

- Submit/approve/NotRequired; Pending blocks disable; self-approval denied; material edit blocked
- Direct `IIvInventoryPostingService.PostAsync` GR and NG: Pending/Absent/Rejected blocked; Approved/NotRequired/OFF permitted per D3
- Multi-PO all-or-nothing
- Revise vs GR (barrier)
- NEW WAC/Standard/FIFO backdated GR gated; rollback/VR not gated
- Repair `PostAsync` treated as NEW post (D5)
- Picker &gt;100 with first window unapproved; no cutover row from search
- File staging / DB rollback orphan cleanup
- DI resolves real guard

SQL concurrency (isolated DB, barriers): two policy publishers; enable vs GR; disable vs Pending; submit vs submit; approve vs edit/revise; approve vs reject; PR convert vs Return/Withdraw; grandfathered partial RecvQty; TZ/Created vs CutoverAtUtc; cross-company isolation.

**Required SQL tests cannot be skipped.** Unit SQLite tests do **not** satisfy Gate 3.

